SUMMARY:[Control & Robotics][Reinforcement Learning] RSS 2027 - Stage 1 ext
 ended abstract submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Robotics: Science and Systems\nWebsite: https
 ://roboticsconference.org/\nSource URL: https://roboticsconference.org/in
 formation/cfp/\nLocation: Athens\, Greece\nTopics: Control & Robotics\, R
 einforcement Learning\, System Identification & Data-driven Dynamics\, Co
 mputer Vision & Pattern Recognition\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper-base
 d\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-30\nNotes: New two-s
 tage 2027 process requires a six-page initial submission by December 4\, 
 2026. Only authors invited after review may submit the April final paper\
 ; it is not a fresh-paper route after stage 1 closes. Rechecked 2026-10-3
 0 with no change\; the OpenReview submission form is not public yet. Size
  is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Focused robotics research linking perc
 eption\, learning\, planning\, control\, manipulation\, and robot-system 
 science. Reinforcement and imitation learning\, model-based behavior\, an
 d reliable autonomous systems are characteristic intersections. The 2027 
 review process emphasizes a scientifically developed robotic hypothesis t
 hrough gated initial and invited final submissions.\nAdditional topics: P
 lanning & Search\, Deep Representation Learning\, Probabilistic\, Causal 
 & Uncertainty ML\, Robustness & Safety\nScope sources (2027): https://rob
 oticsconference.org/information/cfp/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
